      "value": "Thank you for the report!\n\nThe new system now applies SteamVR skeletal tracking data to avatar hands, which may change the way they appear.\n\nIf the new skeletal hand tracking still looks off on your avatar, you can adjust your avatar rig's muscle configuration in Unity. The muscle ranges configured in the humanoid rig configuration are considered when applying the SteamVR skeletal hand data.",
